float"><label>Figure 5</label><caption><p>Reconstructed <italic>in vivo</italic> images of (<italic>a</italic>) Hb (&#x003bc;M), (<italic>b</italic>) HbO<sub>2</sub> (&#x003bc;M), (<italic>c</italic>) H<sub>2</sub>O (%) and (<italic>d</italic>) acoustic velocity (mm&#x0200a;s<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>) from a mouse with a subcutaneous tumour.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="rsta20090083f05"/></fig><table-wrap id="tbl1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Chromophore concentrations and acoustic velocity for test objects.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">object position</th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">HbO<sub>2</sub> (&#x003bc;M)</th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Hb (&#x003bc;M)</th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">H<sub>2</sub>O (%)</th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">acoustic velocity (&#x000d7;10<sup>6</sup>&#x0200a;mm&#x0200a;s<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">background</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">6</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.44</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">top right</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">12</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">50</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.44</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">top left</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">6</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">12</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.44</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">bottom middle</td><td align="char" cha